# /efoil-game/ — cache policy for an UNLISTED TEST BUILD, 22 Sep 2026
#
# THE PROBLEM THIS SOLVES, measured on the live server before it was written:
#
#   /efoil-game/                     Cache-Control: no-cache          (revalidates, fine)
#   /efoil-game/src/main.js          Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable
#   /efoil-game/assets/foam.png      Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable
#
# The PAGE revalidates but the 109 ES modules it imports do not. `immutable`
# tells the browser not even to ask. So a phone that loads this game once keeps
# that exact copy for a YEAR, and every update pushed after it would be
# invisible to the one device we most need to test on.
#
# The usual fix — a ?v= on the URL — does not work here, because ES modules
# import each other by bare relative path inside the source. Versioning the
# entry point busts main.js and nothing else; every one of its imports would
# need rewriting, which needs a build step this game deliberately does not have
# (zero dependencies, no bundler, 109 plain modules).
#
# So while this is a TEST BUILD that changes often, correctness beats speed:
# revalidate everything. The cost is a conditional request per module on a
# repeat visit; they come back 304 and near-instantly.
#
# ⚠️ REVERSE THIS BEFORE ANY REAL LAUNCH. When the game is bundled and its
# filenames carry a content hash, the year-long immutable cache is exactly what
# you want and this file should be deleted. Leaving it in place on a launched
# build would throw away the best caching the platform gives you.
#
# ⚠️ IT MAY NOT WORK. This project has already been bitten once by SiteGround
# answering from a platform handler ABOVE .htaccess — see the robots.txt note in
# the site root, where a Crawl-delay is injected no matter what the file says,
# and the portal's freshness beacon, where un-versioned files stuck in the proxy
# and only a NEW URL rescued them. If the header below does not appear on a live
# request, the proxy is overriding it and the fallback is to version the FOLDER
# (/efoil-game-2/) on each update. Measure it; do not assume it took.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  <FilesMatch "\.(js|png|webmanifest|html)$">
    Header set Cache-Control "no-cache, must-revalidate"
  </FilesMatch>
</IfModule>
